  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community-Based Malaria Prevention, Detection, and Treatment in Mobility Impacted Communities in Mon State and Sagaing Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will implement community-based malaria case management in hard-to-reach areas including migrant clusters and worksites in targeted townships. The Integrated Community Malaria Volunteers (ICMV) will be supported to identify and refer TB, HIV, and other health care conditions as appropriate. IOM will implement fully integration model for Malaria and TB community-based referrals and DOT support till completion of anti TB treatment, and those targets will be included in TB proposal. IOM will use township level and village level implementation resources for Malaria and TB not only in Mon but also in Sagging. Case- based reporting with mobile technology will be continue implemented for real time reporting as feasible.</narrative>
  </description>
